sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Kiosk screen
    participant P as Patient phone
    participant S as Express API
    participant R as Reasoning model
    participant D as MongoDB
    K->>S: GET /api/stations/station-2/code
    S-->>K: signed code, expires in 10 min
    P->>P: Begin contactless scan, read the QR (jsQR)
    P->>S: POST /api/stations/verify
    S-->>P: station verified
    P->>S: POST /api/scans
    S->>D: scan record (linked)
    Note over S,K: capturing, 12 s · the kiosk follows the stages
    S->>R: POST /run with the station's case
    R-->>S: level, rule, readings, explanation card
    S->>D: report + share code
    S-->>P: done → session report
    Note over P,R: A printed case QR skips the station:<br/>verify → /api/triage/run → result screen
